            <ArticleTitle>Breathe easy: 5 steps to better breathing with your metered-dose inhaler (MDI).</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S0735-6757(17)30378-9</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.ajem.2017.05.014</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Proper use of the metered-dose inhaler (MDI) is essential for medications to prevent and treat acute asthma exacerbations. This training video teaches children and clinicians correct technique for MDI use.</AbstractText>
